Maintainer: Mustapha Wasseja <mmohammed@method-vm.co.uk>
Description: Provides an experimental R-native interface for constructing,
    validating, and compiling algebraic optimisation models intended for
    execution by a separately installed GAMS system. The package is an
    independent community project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
    GAMS Development Corporation.
